Description: "vulkan" provider: the Vulkan plugin EP of onnxruntime
 The plugin (libonnxruntime_ep_vulkan.so, onnx-vulkan-rs) is registered once
 and its first device appended with SessionOptionsAppendExecutionProvider_V2;
 without the plugin or a device the session stays on the CPU.
Author: Grigory Tuboltsev
Forwarded: no

